# Miles Bar Chart — 7 bars for a week's (random) miles; a paged horizontal list
# of "week of <date>" labels under the chart drives the active week
# (floor((offset + w/2) / w) in a derived value), and each bar springs its
# height and colour to the new week's value, with a haptic per week change.
# What this test covers: paging week by week through all 7 weeks and back,
# a half drag released before the snap, slow drags held across the half-way
# point (active index flips mid-drag, bars retarget mid-spring), hard flings
# to both ends and rubber-band overscroll past them (index must stay within
# the 7 weeks), and a fling stopped by a touch. Labels row: y ~522, hitSlop 100.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/miles-bar-chart"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "text" "week of" 30000
wait 1000
# Week by week forward.
swipe 330 540 70 540
wait 900
swipe 330 540 70 540
wait 900
swipe 330 540 70 540
wait 900
# Half drag, released before the snap point.
gesture pan 300 540 -120 0 900
wait 900
# Held across the midpoint and back.
gesture pan 300 540 -230 0 1500
wait 900
gesture pan 100 540 230 0 1500
wait 900
# Hard flings to the end, then overscroll past the last week.
swipe 395 540 5 540
wait 300
swipe 395 540 5 540
wait 300
swipe 395 540 5 540
wait 300
swipe 395 540 5 540
wait 1200
gesture pan 395 540 -390 0 250
wait 1200
wait "text" "week of" 8000
# Back to the first week and overscroll past it.
swipe 5 540 395 540
wait 300
swipe 5 540 395 540
wait 300
swipe 5 540 395 540
wait 300
swipe 5 540 395 540
wait 1200
gesture pan 5 540 390 0 250
wait 1200
# Fling and stop it with a touch.
swipe 395 540 5 540
wait 120
press 200 540
wait 1000
# Drags in the label's hitSlop area above/below the row.
swipe 330 450 70 450
wait 900
swipe 70 610 330 610
wait 900
wait "text" "week of" 8000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
